@startuml feature-weather-page-target
title Weather Page Target Feature Flow

' Purpose: Show the planned deeper evidence view for weather and seasonal inputs.

actor User
participant "Weather Page" as WeatherPage
participant "Evidence View" as EvidenceView
participant "Spot and Species Controls" as SpotAndSpeciesControls

User -> WeatherPage: Open weather page
WeatherPage --> User: Show readiness evidence for the current spot and species

User -> EvidenceView: Inspect precipitation, temperature, seasonal state, and confidence
EvidenceView --> User: Show charts, tables, and explanation for the result

alt User wants to compare or change context
  User -> SpotAndSpeciesControls: Change spot or species
  SpotAndSpeciesControls --> WeatherPage: Updated spot or species selection
  WeatherPage --> User: Refresh evidence for the new context
else User keeps the same context
  WeatherPage --> User: Keep the deeper evidence view available
end

alt Supporting data is available
  EvidenceView --> User: Show how recent conditions and seasonal patterns influence readiness
else Supporting data is sparse or unavailable
  EvidenceView --> User: Show low-confidence explanation and what data is missing
end

@enduml